{"segs": ["PA_ja_47:0.2", "PA_ja_47:0.3"], "en": "Ekakanipāta, Atthakāmavagga (The Section on Those Who Desire Welfare)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_47:0.4"], "en": "7. The Vāruṇidūsaka Jātaka “Indeed,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_47:1.1"], "en": "for one who is unskilled in what is beneficial,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_47:1.2"], "en": "conduct that aims at welfare does not bring happiness.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_47:1.3"], "en": "“The fool ruins his own welfare,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_47:1.4"], "en": "just as Koṇḍañña ruined the wine.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_47:2.1"], "en": "Thus ends the seventh Jātaka, the Vāruṇidūsaka Jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
